              "start_line": 2,
              "end_line": 2,
              "text": "Displayed response: `Selected: notebook!`, followed by a newline. `sep=': '` replaces the default space; `end='!\\n'` replaces the default newline. Without these overrides, `print('Selected', label)` displays `Selected notebook`, followed by a newline."
            }
